e it.  I'm pretty sure I'll be able to go, but I'm not 100% positive at this point (family obligations and all).  I'll know more definitely later in the week.<br><br>It will be interesting to see Permafrost again.  Last time I was there was with my monk who was in his mid-30s at the time.  Giants there scared me, so I think it's time to teach them a lesson.  Hehe. <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> Tressia</span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/9/01 7:50:42 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=31.topic&index=2>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> d'oh</span><hr size=1> Yup, that is Easter weekend, thanks for reminding me I need to get to the bunny store Jaqal!! Anyway, I am not sure I can make it then either as we have plans to attend church services that night.  Perhaps the following weekend would be better?  Would hate to say sign me up then not be there.<br><br>*Tressia<br><br>Last time I was there was just a youngling and was not allowed past the front door on guild raid - lol.  Would love to go back.<br> <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/uchumbii.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Chumb II</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/9/01 7:51:04 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=31.topic&index=3>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Permafrost Raid Saturday, 4/14, 7 pm Central Time</span><hr size=1> TW is taking on Lady Vox that morning (after noon eastern time), so I'll log out Chumb at the entrance after the raid if you need me for tank support.  I too haven't been to far in, just to the Patriarch (that gob who drops the item needed for crafted boots).  I should be able to stay for your whole raid unless RL or the Guild calls me for Guild Duty.  Well, let me know!  Thanks.<br><br><br>Bring the THUNDER! Victory or death!<br> <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/umeakkonthebold.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Meakkon the Bold</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/10/01 6:27:02 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=31.topic&index=4>Reply</a>   <BR><img src=http://members.aol.com/eqgraphics/meakkon.jpg WIDTH=60 HEIGHT=60></td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Permafrost Raid Saturday, 4/14, 7 pm Central Time</span><hr size=1> Chumb, are you a troll?  Could have sworn I saw a guy with your name last night in Permafrost, but he said he wasn't the guy who posted on the Golden Legion board. <p>Meakkon the Bold, mighty hobbit warrior and taunter</p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/uchumbii.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Chumb II</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/10/01 7:51:01 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=31.topic&index=5>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Permafrost Raid Saturday, 4/14, 7 pm Central Time</span><hr size=1> Yeah the server crashed and Vox was respawned, so a friend played Chumb. So, technically it wasn't me.  We had a really bad pull and couldn't take Vox down, so I'll still be there Saturday if you guys need me.  <!--EZCODE EMOTICON START :o --><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/intl/aenglish/images/emoticons/embarassed.gif ALT=":o"><!--EZCODE EMOTICON END--> ) <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/uzilben.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Zilben</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/10/01 9:51:59 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=31.topic&index=6>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Permafrost Raid Saturday, 4/14, 7 pm Central Time</span><hr size=1> I would like to come, last time I was there was lvl 25 and wasn't too keen on venturing inside.<br><br>I'll try to come, but it is Easter weekend and depending on family obligations, it might prove difficult.<br><br>Zilben<br>GL Motto: BRING THE BOOZE OR BRING ME DEATH <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/umeakkonthebold.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Meakkon the Bold</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/10/01 10:00:55 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=31.topic&index=7>Reply</a>   <BR><img src=http://members.aol.com/eqgraphics/meakkon.jpg WIDTH=60 HEIGHT=60></td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Permafrost Raid Saturday, 4/14, 7 pm Central Time</span><hr size=1> Here is some information on what's in Permafrost and attainable by us (not Lady Vox).  I’ve put in the EQPrices.com information, including some class and race restrictions, and just for comparison purposes only, prices).  Some of these items look pretty darn good, with some luck, something for everybody on the need before greed system.<br><br>3 &quot;King's Room&quot; - King Thex'Ka IV who drops Symbol of Loyalty to Vox (Common drop, AC 7, wrists, Sv cold +7, all but Iksar, 85pp) and White Wolf Hide Cloak (Rare drop, AC 7, back, +3str, +3dex, +5cold 1300pp), Ice Goblin Patriarch who drops Frost Goblin Totem (mana +5, Sv cold +10, part of warrior's crafted boots quest, no drop), and Elite Goblin Guards who drop Icy Greaves (AC8, Sv Cold +5, bard, cleric, SHK, warrior, paladin, no drop), Frost Goblin Skin (??), and Elite Honor Guards who drop Silvery War Axe (Common drop, 1HS, 6-22, 5.91 damage per second, 120pp), and Silvery Two-Handed Axe (Rare drop, 2HS, 21-48, 8.96 damage per second, effect serpent sight, 430pp), and High Priest Zaharn who drops Zaharn's Coronet (AC5, head, +3str, +25 mana, cleric/druid/ shaman, but no Iksar, Ogres, Trolls, 140pp)<br><br>4 Goblin Archeologist who drops Archeologists Pack (Common drop, 6 slots, 25% weight reduction, 220pp) and Dented Brass Mask (Rare drop, face, AC4, Str+3, 300pp, melee and cleric, shaman classes) <br><br>6 Goblin Preacher who drops Cold Iron Morning Star (Common drop, 1hb,9-45, all but int casters, 5.43 damage per second, 95pp) and Runed Circlet (Rare drop, +4int, +4wis, head, AC4, 310pp) <br><br>7 &quot;Flag Room&quot; I'm not sure what drops here.<br><br>8 Goblin Alchemist who drops Mammoth Hide Leggings (Common drop, AC 6, Sta+3, Cold +5, 45pp) and Mammoth Hide Cloak (Rare drop, AC 7, back, Wis+4, Cold +5, 1800pp) <br><br>9 Goblin Jail Master who drops Wooly Silk Net (Common drop, 3 charges of snare, 20pp) and Etched Ivory Charm (Rare drop, AC 5, neck, +2Str, +2Int, +2Wis, all but int casters, 460pp)  <br><br>10 Goblin Scryer who drops Ice Crystal Staff (Common drop, 1hb, 5-28, 3.93 damage per second, int casters &amp; bards, 50pp) and White Wolf Slippers (Rare drop, AC 2, feet, AGI +7, +20 mana, 690pp)  <p>Meakkon the Bold, mighty hobbit warrior and taunter</p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/umeakkonthebold.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Meakkon the Bold</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/10/01 10:04:31 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=31.topic&index=8>Reply</a>   <BR><img src=http://members.aol.com/eqgraphics/meakkon.jpg WIDTH=60 HEIGHT=60></td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Permafrost Raid Saturday, 4/14, 7 pm Central Time</span><hr size=1> Easter -- on holiday weekends, some people have more time to play (less work hopefully or perhaps significant other is out of town, etc.) and some people have less time to play (out of town, family obligations, etc.).  If you can make it great, if real life intrudes, not a problem at all, just come if you can and try (as those above have done) to let me know in advance.  I'll take definites, maybes, probablies, etc. <p>Meakkon the Bold, mighty hobbit warrior and taunter</p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> tressia</span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/10/01 12:41:52 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=31.topic&index=9>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> permafrost</span><hr size=1> I think we can attend the same service sunday night, so go ahead and count me in.<br><br>*Tressia<br> <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/usinse7en.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Sinse7en</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/10/01 9:07:24 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=31.topic&index=10>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Raid</span><hr size=1> I'll tag along.<br><br>Procyon <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/ubelnorsilverheart.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Belnor Silverheart</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/11/01 6:57:51 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=31.topic&index=11>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Raid</span><hr size=1> I dont think I'll be able to make it for this raid. Saturdays are usually when pick up my kids and spend the day with them. I can get one once they are in bed but that will prolly be about 3hrs after the start of the raid. If things change I'll let ya all know.<br><br>Belnor Silverheart<br>Cleric of Tunare <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/uexidorgangleri.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Exidor Gangleri</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/11/01 7:08:38 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=31.topic&index=12>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Raid</span><hr size=1> I will give you a definite maybe, as I never know what time I will be on on a Saturday. <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/umeakkonthebold.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Meakkon the Bold</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/11/01 7:34:58 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=31.topic&index=13>Reply</a>   <BR><img src=http://members.aol.com/eqgraphics/meakkon.jpg WIDTH=60 HEIGHT=60></td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Permafrost Raid Saturday, 4/14, 7 pm Central Time</span><hr size=1> Thanks for the information, for those that haven't responded and you think there's a chance you can make it, please let me know.  And those that read the board, please remind people in the game about the raid.  Things is shaping up, so it looks like we're on.  Here is current raid lineup:<br><br>Meakkon - yes  (mighty hobbit warrior and taunter)<br>Procyon - yes  (druid)<br><br>Jaqal - probably  (enchanter)<br>Chumb - probably  (warrior from Thunderwalkers)<br>Tyho - probably (monk)<br><br>Exidor - maybe  (ranger)<br>Zilben - maybe  (wizard)<br><br>Tressia - probably later  (ranger)<br>Lyissa - probably later (bard)<br>Belnor - maybe later (cleric)<br>Zankor - maybe later (shadowknight) <p>Meakkon the Bold, mighty hobbit warrior and taunter</p><i>Edited by: <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/umeakkonthebold.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Meakkon the Bold</A> at: 4/12/01 12:22:24 pm<br></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/uzankor.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Zankor</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/11/01 7:03:13 pm)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=31.topic&index=14>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Raid</span><hr size=1> I don't think I will be able to make it.  RL calls until about 10:30pm Central Saturday. But if you guys are still beating up on Perma at that time I will join in the blood bath.  <br><br>Zankor <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> Tressia</span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/12/01 6:33:41 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=31.topic&index=15>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> sigh</span><hr size=1> Meakkon, I am truly sorry but my husband has &quot;shaft duty&quot; all day sunday so we are not able to change plans, I probably will not be around sat until after 9 or 10 - but will also glady join in at that time.<br><br>*Tressia <p></p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/ulyissa26.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Lyissa26</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/12/01 8:07:21 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=31.topic&index=16>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: Permafrost Raid Saturday, 4/14, 7 pm Central Time</span><hr size=1> i get ofdf work at 2100 <p>When the curse of life fades away...all that remains is sorrowLyissa Sylvannis</p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#cccb9b><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/ulyissa26.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Lyissa26</A></span><br> <span class=usertitle>Registered User</span><br> <font color=#330000>(4/12/01 8:08:12 am)</font><br>   <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=31.topic&index=17>Reply</a>   </td><td valign=top align=left class=m><span class=title> Re: sigh</span><hr size=1> i am going out oftown tommthrn work till 9 sat <p>When the curse of life fades away...all that remains is sorrowLyissa Sylvannis</p><i></i></td></tr><tr bgcolor=#deddbf><td nowrap width=20% valign=top align=left><span class=title> Tyho</span><br> <span class=usertitle>Unregistered User</span><br> 